Should I think about myself?

806
00:59:37.682 --> 00:59:38.681
Will you break up?

807
00:59:41.878 --> 00:59:44.595
If I want this, will you break up?

808
00:59:45.594 --> 00:59:46.593
Salt.

809
00:59:49.750 --> 00:59:51.189
Leave Kim Tae-sung.

810
00:59:51.908 --> 00:59:52.907
You...

811
00:59:53.946 --> 00:59:55.105
I like you.

812
01:00:21.079 --> 01:00:24.036
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN

813
01:00:24.116 --> 01:00:25.315
Does Sun Jae like me?

814
01:00:25.395 --> 01:00:28.511
Does such a bright guy like me?

815
01:00:28.631 --> 01:00:30.070
He understood everything.

816
01:00:30.310 --> 01:00:32.228
- Let's talk.
- She doesn't want to.

817
01:00:32.308 --> 01:00:33.866
- Go away.
- Come with me.

818
01:00:33.946 --> 01:00:35.624
Tae Sung will figure it out.

819
01:00:35.704 --> 01:00:37.103
What if they touch her?

820
01:00:37.183 --> 01:00:39.341
What's the matter, seriously?

821
01:00:39.421 --> 01:00:41.419
- Hello.
- No salt, I'll go.

822
01:00:42.178 --> 01:00:44.775
- Don't go.
- I wanted to wait a little longer...

823
01:00:45.175 --> 01:00:46.653
but I can't do it anymore.

824
01:00:47.373 --> 01:00:48.372
You tell me...

825
01:00:49.051 --> 01:00:53.526
Sun Jae, I'm sorry, I won't go out.

826
01:00:53.966 --> 01:00:55.085
Don't wait for me.

827
01:00:55.964 --> 01:00:59.161
Translated and voiced by the studio
"Mobile TV"

828
01:00:59.241 --> 01:01:01.878
commissioned by the online cinema Ivy
in 2024.

